    D(b) = (1 + c)(1 − |b̄|/Y)₊ − c, where b̄ is the representative of b mod N in (−N/2, N/2].
  - The lead can supply details on request in the report.
- Dilation pinch: for q >= 1, Σ_{j=0}^{q−1} cosSum A (2πj/q) = q·|A ∩ qℕ|, hence |A ∩ qℕ| >= |A|/q − (1 − 1/q)M.

