hypothesis and is not hidden in the Nikolskii constant. -/
theorem p31_of_factorization (L w : ℕ) (A : Finset ℕ) (M C : ℝ)
    (hA : ∀ a ∈ A, 0 < a) (hnik : AnalyticNikolskii L C)
    (hfactor : WindowFactorization L w A M) :
